      "teacher_text": "To calculate the number of pages James writes in a year, we need to multiply the number of pages he writes per week by the number of weeks in a year.\n\nPages per week = 3 pages\nWeeks in a year = 52 weeks\n\nTotal pages per year = Pages per week x Weeks in a year\n= 3 pages x 52 weeks\n= 156 pages\n\nTherefore, James writes 156 pages in a year.<|end_turn|>",
